  "id": "deterministic-process",
  "term": "deterministic process",
  "definition": "A deterministic process is an orderly influence in a dynamical system that pushes behavior toward a preferred or desired state. In the postural-control context described here, it is the part of the system that makes body sway tend to drift back toward stable posture rather than vary only because of noise.",
